              "value": "Coreceptor required for sonic hedgehog (SHH) handoff to its receptor: binds to the dually lipid-modified Sonic hedgehog protein N-product (ShhN) downstream of the CDON-BOC heterodimer and directly transfers ShhN to its patched receptor (PTCH1 or PTCH2), followed by activation of the smoothened signaling pathway (PubMed:35231446). Specifically recognizes and binds palmitate and cholesterol moieties in dually lipid-modified ShhN (PubMed:35231446). Binds 20(S)-hydroxycholesterol (20(S)-OHC) (By similarity). Acts as a growth arrest protein involved in growth suppression by blocking entry to S phase (PubMed:8127893)"
            }
